do not change the code of the main method, you should keep your code like this

'''java
public class Main ``{``
    
    public static double getGradeCap(String grade) ``{``
        // ADD YOUR CODE HERE
    ``}``
    
    public static void main(String[] args) ``{``
        System.out.println("A+: " + getGradeCap("A+"));
        System.out.println("B : " + getGradeCap("B"));
    ``}``
``}``
'''

you should only change the code inside the getGradeCap method, which should return a `double` when inputted a `String`
